# Go source, shell scripts and the git hooks must use LF on every host.
#
# Without this a Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true — which is the
# default on a GitHub Actions windows-latest runner — converts every file to
# CRLF, and `gofmt -s -l` then reports all 153 Go files as unformatted. The
# Windows CI job added in this commit cannot pass without it, and a contributor
# cloning on Windows would hit the same wall locally.
#
# Every tracked file in this repository is text, so normalising all of them is
# the whole rule rather than a list that has to be maintained.
* text=auto eol=lf
